Orre @VERSION@ for Linux (@ARCH@)
================================

Orre is a local-first personal finance dashboard. This archive holds a
release build of the `orre` binary: no Rust toolchain, Nix or devenv needed.

Run it
------

    tar xzf orre-@VERSION@-linux-@ARCH@.tar.gz
    cd orre-@VERSION@-linux-@ARCH@
    ./orre              # opens the app
    ./orre --help       # the headless commands (import, backup, mcp, ...)

To install it for your user, so a launcher can find it:

    install -Dm755 orre ~/.local/bin/orre
    install -Dm644 orre.desktop ~/.local/share/applications/orre.desktop
    install -Dm644 orre.png ~/.local/share/icons/hicolor/1024x1024/apps/orre.png

(`~/.local/bin` must be on your PATH for the launcher's `Exec=orre`.)

Your data lives in ~/.local/share/orre (set ORRE_DATA_DIR to use another
folder). Orre makes no network requests.

Requirements
------------

- x86_64 Linux with glibc @GLIBC@ or newer (this binary's highest
  versioned glibc symbol is GLIBC_@GLIBC@; built on @BUILD_HOST@).
- A Wayland or X11 session and a Vulkan driver (Mesa is fine).
- These shared libraries, which most desktop installs already have:

  Library          Debian / Ubuntu                   Fedora
  --------------   -------------------------------   ----------------------
  wayland-client   libwayland-client0                libwayland-client
  xkbcommon        libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0 libxkbcommon, libxkbcommon-x11
  xcb, X11         libxcb1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1    libxcb, libX11, libX11-xcb
  Vulkan loader    libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers   vulkan-loader, mesa-vulkan-drivers
  fontconfig       libfontconfig1                    fontconfig
  freetype         libfreetype6                      freetype

orre links xkbcommon and xcb directly and loads the others when it starts.
fontconfig and freetype are in GPUI's library list but weren't loaded in
our X11 test; if Orre won't start, install them too. Fonts (Inter, Geist
Mono) are built into the binary.

